race, color, religion, social class, gender, age, motorcycle brand, etc.<\\/p><p>\\u00a0<\\/p><p>L.A.M.A. Chicago was the sole chapter for 19 years until, in 1996, its first sister chapter was born in Miami and the group elected a National President. In 2000, L.A.M.A. celebrated the Millenium by going global, creating L.A.M.A. International Motorcycle Association (I.M.A.) with the addition of chapters in Puerto Rico, Mexico and Cuba. <\\/p>\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=text\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3197874\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"11b0076e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"flex_gap\":{\"column\":\"50\",\"row\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":true,\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":50}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"300e9a95\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3048c3a3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>L.A.M.A. continued to expand in 2006 when it introduced Moto-Touring. Moto-Touring is an adventure sport that challenges participants to ride extreme distances, logging miles as they go. L.A.M.A. holds Regional, National, Continental, and World Championships for Moto-Touring, giving members the chance to meet L.A.M.A.s in lands near and far.<\\/p>\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=text\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3197874\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"1f038e12\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":70,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3ce097b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"274290b0\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"flex_gap\":{\"column\":\"50\",\"row\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":true,\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":50}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3c836ee7\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5cc4637e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"62d0d6ad\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"665a9603\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p class=\\\"paragraph\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: \'Aptos\',sans-serif;\\\">Finally, Damas de L.A.M.A. (the ladies of L.A.M.A.) is an important part of the Latin American Motorcycle Association. Their motto: \\u201cWe Ride Our Own\\u201d. Most motorcyclists find traveling extreme distances to be difficult but L.A.M.A. men and women perform these rides often, and they would have it no other way!<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"paragraph\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: \'Aptos\',sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"paragraph\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: \'Aptos\',sans-serif;\\\">L.A.M.A.\\/I.M.A. abide by statutes and regulations, and value clear association guidelines internationally. <\\/span><\\/p>\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=text\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3197874\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"42f84196\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":300,\"sizes\":[]},\"width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"align\":\"center\",\"text\":\"Divider\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":5,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=4478c39\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"5177fb1f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\",\"flex_align_items\":\"center\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"80\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"547130d4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"text\":\"Join Us!\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"},{\"id\":\"1e555f2b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"Discover all L.A.M.A. has to offer!<br>\\nTake some time to browse the website and reach out with any questions.\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=3197874\"},\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}]');
